        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"delta-minimax-group-sequential-design-no-penalty-bo\">Delta-Minimax Group Sequential Design \u2014 No Penalty BO</h1>\n<h2 id=\"reverse-parameterisation-integer-n-local-search-no-penalty\">Reverse Parameterisation + Integer <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(n||)</marimo-tex> + Local Search + No Penalty</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Identical to the simple local BO except the objective is evaluated\nas the raw <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\max_\\delta E[N \\mid \\delta] / \\mu||)</marimo-tex> with <strong>no penalty</strong> for\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\alpha'||)</marimo-tex> violations. This allows us to understand the true shape of the\nobjective surface without penalty distortion.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Risk: infeasible designs with liberal boundaries may have lower ESS than\nfeasible ones, potentially misleading the GPR. The assessment cell at the\nend reports what fraction of the best designs found are actually feasible.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
