          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"integer-n-by-bisection\">Integer <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(n||)</marimo-tex> by Bisection</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Finds smallest integer <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(n||)</marimo-tex> per arm per stage achieving target power.\nReturns <code>None</code> if no <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(n \\leq 200||)</marimo-tex> suffices.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
