            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"initialisation\">Initialisation</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Local: 15 perturbations around triangular design only</li>\n<li>Global: 5 perturbations around each of Pocock, O'Brien-Fleming, triangular</li>\n<li>Plus up to 15 feasible random points from pool within search space</li>\n</ul></span>"
