          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"bayesian-optimisation-loop\">Bayesian Optimisation Loop</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Standard ask-tell loop. Every evaluation feeds the GPR \u2014 feasible designs\ncontribute clean objective values, infeasible designs contribute penalised\nvalues that guide the GPR away from the infeasible region.</span></span>"
